# Wave W17-J (Route 44): cold turf — frost-burned thin grass on the cold shoulder of the mountain, a grey-green going pale at the edges where the frost keeps it, last grass before the ice cave (design: calm speckled grass going thin and cold under pines, frost-burned grass at the path’s edge). Route 44’s own ground.
